  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The «tú» command",
     "texto": [
      "With a regular verb, the command for **tú** is the same as the **él** form:\n\n- hablar → **habla**\n- comer → **come**\n- escribir → **escribe**\n\nTwo you must learn whole: **ven** (venir) and **haz** (hacer). To sound kind add **por favor**: **Habla más despacio, por favor.**\n\nTo say no, change the final vowel: **habla** becomes **no hables**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "How the command is formed",
     "texto": [
      "Three steps:\n\n- **Regular**: the **él** form of the present. **Come**, **escribe**, **mira**, **repite**.\n- **Irregular**: **ven** (venir) and **haz** (hacer). They do not follow the rule.\n- **Negative**: **no** + a different form. **Habla** → **no hables**; **come** → **no comas**; **escribe** → **no escribas**.\n\nTo ask politely, add **por favor**."
     ],
     "ejemplos": [
